---
title: "price_info::deposit_fee_coins (Pyth Sui Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check: exists_with_type(price_info_object.id, FEE_STORAGE_KEY)
    q_check --> q_add: false, dynamic_object_field::add(id, FEE_STORAGE_KEY, fee_coins)
    q_check --> q_join: true
    q_join --> q_borrow: current_fee = borrow_mut(id, FEE_STORAGE_KEY)
    q_borrow --> q_merge: coin::join(current_fee, fee_coins)
    q_add --> [*]: return
    q_merge --> [*]: return

    note right of q_check
        INV-001: first deposit creates the fee storage dynamic field
        INV-002: subsequent deposits merge coins via coin::join
        INV-003: anyone can deposit fee coins (public function)
    end note
